---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="x1zz — eliminating technical debt and accelerating human technological evolution through sLM + IR + Rust Engine architecture." />
  <title>x1zz</title>

  <!-- Fonts: JetBrains Mono + Inter with display=swap -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" />
</head>
<body class="bg-black text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">

  <!-- ─── HEADER ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <header class="w-full border-b border-zinc-800 px-6 py-4 grid grid-cols-3 items-center gap-4">

    <!-- Left: Status indicator -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white pulse-dot shrink-0"></span>
      <span class="text-xs tracking-widest text-white" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">STATUS // SYSTEM_READY</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Center: Manifesto slogan -->
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-white uppercase text-center" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
        The combination of art and technology
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Language toggle -->
    <div class="flex justify-end">
      <button
        id="lang-toggle"
        aria-label="Toggle language"
        class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest border border-zinc-600 text-white hover:border-white transition-all duration-150 px-3 py-1 cursor-pointer"
        style="font-family: var(--font-mono);"
      >
        <span class="lang-en">EN → KR</span>
        <span class="lang-kr">KR → EN</span>
      </button>
    </div>

  </header>

  <!-- ─── HERO ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="w-full px-6 py-20 flex flex-col items-center">

    <!-- Signature 1px line with x1zz cutout -->
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-3xl flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="absolute w-full border-t-[1px] border-zinc-800"></div>
      <h1 class="relative z-10 bg-black px-8 text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-white select-none" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
        x1zz
      </h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Tagline -->
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl w-full">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white lang-en">
        An AI-native infrastructure primitive. We eliminate code debt at the root—injecting a
        <span class="text-white font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">[sLM → IR → Rust Engine]</span>
        hybrid pipeline into early-stage ventures to unlock irreversible structural advantage.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white lang-kr">
        AI 네이티브 인프라 프리미티브. 코드 부채를 근원에서 제거합니다—
        <span class="text-white font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">[sLM → IR → Rust 엔진]</span>
        하이브리드 파이프라인을 초기 스타트업에 주입하여 돌이킬 수 없는 구조적 우위를 창출합니다.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ─── THREE PILLARS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <main class="flex-1 w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20 space-y-6">

    <!-- Section label -->
    <div class="border-b border-zinc-800 pb-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-white uppercase" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
        <span class="lang-en">// DIRECTORY_INDEX</span>
        <span class="lang-kr">// 디렉토리 인덱스</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Pillar 1: Xizzthesizer ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <a href="/synthesizer" class="group block border border-zinc-800 p-6 rounded hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-150">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/Xizzthesizer_logo.png" alt="Xizzthesizer" class="h-6 w-auto opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:invert transition-all duration-150" />
          <code class="text-sm font-bold text-white group-hover:text-black transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">/synthesizer</code>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
          <span class="lang-en">[ART &amp; TECH ESSAYS]</span>
          <span class="lang-kr">[예술 및 테크 에세이]</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-en">
        A digital media lab exploring the profound synthesis of technology, human philosophy, and aesthetic computing.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-kr">
        기술과 인간 철학, 그리고 미학적 컴퓨팅의 강렬한 융합을 탐구하는 디지털 미디어 랩.
      </p>

    </a>

    <!-- ── Pillar 2: x1zzdev ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <a href="/dev" class="group block border border-zinc-800 p-6 rounded hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-150">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/x1zzLang_logo_white.png" alt="x1zzLang" class="h-6 w-auto opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:invert transition-all duration-150" />
          <code class="text-sm font-bold text-white group-hover:text-black transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">/dev</code>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
          <span class="lang-en">[DEVELOPMENT &amp; OPEN SOURCE]</span>
          <span class="lang-kr">[개발 및 오픈소스]</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-en">
        Core engineering home of <code class="text-white group-hover:text-black font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">x1zzLang</code>—a Rust-based DSL compiler running <strong class="text-white group-hover:text-black">3.84×</strong> faster than pandas via a Polars LazyFrame backend—and its graphical React-based Visual DAG Pipeline IDE.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-kr">
        pandas 대비 <strong class="text-white group-hover:text-black">3.84배</strong> 빠른 고성능 Rust/Polars 기반 DSL 컴파일러 <code class="text-white group-hover:text-black font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">x1zzLang</code> 및 비주얼 DAG 파이프라인 IDE 프로젝트의 기술적 작업 증명(PoW).
      </p>

    </a>

    <!-- ── Pillar 3: Portfolio ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <a href="/portfolio" class="group block border border-zinc-800 p-6 rounded hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-150">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <code class="text-sm font-bold text-white group-hover:text-black transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">/portfolio</code>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
          <span class="lang-en">[PORTFOLIO & SHOWCASE]</span>
          <span class="lang-kr">[포트폴리오 및 쇼케이스]</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-en">
        A comprehensive portfolio showcasing the <code class="text-white group-hover:text-black font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">x1zzLang</code> ecosystem — a Rust-based DSL compiler achieving <strong class="text-white group-hover:text-black">3.84×</strong> faster than pandas, and its graphical Visual DAG Pipeline IDE.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-kr">
        <code class="text-white group-hover:text-black font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">x1zzLang</code> 생태계의 종합 포트폴리오 — pandas 대비 <strong class="text-white group-hover:text-black">3.84배</strong> 빠른 Rust 기반 DSL 컴파일러와 비주얼 DAG 파이프라인 IDE를 소개합니다.
      </p>

    </a>

    <!-- ── Pillar 4: x1zz Infra ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <a href="/infra" class="group block border border-zinc-800 p-6 rounded hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-150">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <code class="text-sm font-bold text-white group-hover:text-black transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">/infra</code>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
          <span class="lang-en">[INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTMENT]</span>
          <span class="lang-kr">[인프라 투자 프로토콜]</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-en">
        A composable tech infrastructure protocol for lean startups. We eliminate code debt at its root, injecting <span class="text-white group-hover:text-black font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">[sLM + IR + Rust Engine]</span> stacks into early-stage ventures in exchange for equity. Powered by x1zz.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white group-hover:text-zinc-800 transition-colors duration-150 lang-kr">
        <span class="text-white group-hover:text-black font-bold" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">[sLM + 중간 계층(IR) + Rust 규칙 엔진]</span> 하이브리드 아키텍처를 주입하여 린 스타트업의 기술 장벽과 고정비를 제로로 만드는 플랫폼. 코드가 아닌 영생의 인프라로 가치를 교환합니다.
      </p>

    </a>

  </main>

  <!-- ─── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <footer class="w-full border-t border-zinc-800 px-6 py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">

    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-white" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
      <span>x1zz.com</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-500">|</span>
      <span>BUILD_001</span>
    </div>

    <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-white lang-en" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
      The present desires a brilliant future. The brilliant future desires the present.
    </div>
    <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-white lang-kr" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">
      현재는 찬란한 미래를 원하고, 찬란한 미래는 현재를 원한다.
    </div>

  </footer>

  <!-- ─── Minimal Language Toggle Script ─────────────────────────────────── -->
  <script>
    (function () {
      var btn = document.getElementById('lang-toggle');
      if (!btn) return;
      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var html = document.documentElement;
        var current = html.getAttribute('data-lang') || 'en';
        html.setAttribute('data-lang', current === 'en' ? 'kr' : 'en');
        html.setAttribute('lang', current === 'en' ? 'ko' : 'en');
      });
    })();
  </script>

</body>
</html>
